Title: Rosemary Oil — Part Line
Credit: BTA
Draft date: 2026-09-19
Notes: 30s TikTok Shop UGC. Niche: tiktok_shop_ugc. One synthetic creator, one bathroom, one product.

/*
Claim posture, and it is load-bearing rather than cautious.

Hair GROWTH and hair LOSS claims are drug claims in most markets, on a
listing that is registered as a cosmetic. "Stops shedding in 14 days" is
the version of this script that gets the listing pulled, not the version
that converts better. Every line below is first-person observation of
what one person saw in her own brush, with no timeline promise, no
before/after count and no clinical language.

If that changes, it changes because the listing acquired substantiation,
not because a line tested better.

Beat structure is the format's, not this product's: three seconds of
motion before a face, problem before product, texture before claim, cart
last. The [[bracketed notes]] are production annotations — framing, motion
weight, and which seconds must carry real product rather than generated
footage. The tiktok_shop_ugc niche sets stickers=False, so nothing in
brackets is stamped on the picture.
*/

[[0:00-0:03 | HOOK | real product macro, no avatar, no lip-sync]]

EXT. DARK SLATE COUNTER - PRODUCT MACRO - DAY

A glass dropper hangs over dark slate. One amber bead swells on the tip, holds, falls. It lands and spreads. A sprig of rosemary sits just inside the frame, out of focus.

The camera pushes in fast.

MAYA (V.O.)
Okay so the part-line thing finally stopped freaking me out.

[[TEXT CARD: "the part-line thing" — centred, y~800, holds 0:00-0:02]]
[[REAL FOOTAGE. This plate establishes the true label for the whole video.]]

CUT TO:

[[0:03-0:12 | PROBLEM | Clip 1, motion weight 0.60]]

INT. SMALL BATHROOM - MIRROR - MORNING

MAYA, 26, stands at arm's length from a mirror in an oversized washed-black tee, dark hair in a loose messy bun. Window light falls across her from camera left. She is talking to her own phone, not performing to it. Her shoulders sway a little. She blinks twice.

MAYA
My scalp was so dry it was flaking, and every time I brushed there'd be this little pile.

She tips her head fifteen degrees to her right. Her left hand comes up and two fingers part the hair at her crown, holding it open. The scalp shows along the part. She lets it fall.

MAYA (CONT'D)
I stopped wearing my hair up because the part was the first thing I'd see.

[[No on-screen text through this beat — the face carries it.]]
[[Hands must stay fully in frame for the parting gesture.]]

CUT TO:

[[0:12-0:22 | DEMO | Clip 2, motion weight 0.70 — the clip that takes the drift risk]]

INT. SMALL BATHROOM - MIRROR - CONTINUOUS

She raises a small amber dropper bottle into frame at chest height, label turned to the lens, and holds it there.

MAYA
It's rosemary and peppermint — you literally feel it working, that cold tingle.

[[TEXT: "rosemary + peppermint" at 0:13]]
[[REAL PRODUCT REQUIRED 0:13.4-0:15.8 — label faces lens. Planar-track and composite.]]

She draws the glass dropper up, brings it to the top of her head, and releases three drops along the centre part.

INSERT - SCALP, MACRO

Oil beads along the part line and catches the window light. Fingertips arrive and work it in, small circles, unhurried.

[[REAL PRODUCT REQUIRED 0:19.0-0:20.6 — dropper at scalp, or cut to a 0.4s real insert.]]

BACK TO SCENE

MAYA (CONT'D)
Three drops down the part, massage, that's it. No grease, no wash day ruined.

[[TEXT: "3 drops · massage · done" stacked, at 0:17]]

CUT TO:

[[0:22-0:30 | CTA | Clip 3, motion weight 0.55 — face matters more than the sweep]]

INT. SMALL BATHROOM - MIRROR - LATER

Her hair is down now, brushed. She sweeps her right hand through it from crown to ends and lets it fall.

MAYA
Six weeks in and my brush is way emptier.

She turns about twenty degrees toward the camera. Her chin lifts. A small closed-mouth smile that reaches the eyes. Her left hand comes up and points down and to her left, off the bottom of the frame.

MAYA (CONT'D)
It's in the orange cart below — grab it before the bundle sells out again.

[[TEXT: "ORANGE CART ↓" at 0:24, y~1340 — ABOVE the product anchor, never beside it]]
[[TEXT: "bundle deal" at 0:27]]

SMASH CUT TO:

INT. SMALL BATHROOM - COUNTER - CONTINUOUS

The bottle sits on the counter, in focus, label square to the lens. Window light from camera left. Nothing moves.

[[REAL FOOTAGE 0:25.6-0:29.0 — do not fix the generated hold, REPLACE it. Highest-stakes label moment in the video.]]

FADE OUT.
